                )
          %h3#relation_to_skyrmions_calorons_monopoles Relation to Skyrmions, calorons, monopoles
          %p
            The construction of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Skyrmions"} Skyrmions
            from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/instantons"} instantons
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#AtiyahManton89
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"}> Michael Atiyah
              , N S Manton,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Skyrmions from instantons
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(89)90340-7"} doi:10.1016/0370-2693(89)90340-7
          %p
            The relation between
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/skyrmions"} skyrmions
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/instantons"} instantons
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/calorons"} calorons
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/solitons"} solitons
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monopoles"} monopoles
            is usefully reviewed and further developed in
          %ul
            %li#Cork18a
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Josh+Cork"}> Josh Cork
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Calorons, symmetry, and the soliton trinity
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://etheses.whiterose.ac.uk/22097/"} web
            %li#Cork18b
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Josh+Cork"}> Josh Cork
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Skyrmions from calorons
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.04143"} arXiv:1810.04143
          %h3#in_string_theory_2 In string theory
          %p
            In
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            (for
            = succeed ")." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-branes"} D-branes
          %ul
            %li#Witten00
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em World-Sheet Corrections Via D-Instantons
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9907041"} arXiv:hep-th/9907041
            %li
              %p
                Albion Lawrence,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nikita+Nekrasov"} Nikita Nekrasov
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Instanton sums and five-dimensional gauge theories
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9706025"} arXiv:hep-th/9706025
          %p The study of M-brane instantons originates around
          %ul
            %li#BeckerBeckerStrominger95
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Katrin+Becker"}> Katrin Becker
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Melanie+Becker"} Melanie Becker
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Strominger"} Andrew Strominger
              = succeed "," do
                %em Fivebranes, Membranes and Non-Perturbative String Theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9507158"} arXiv:hep-th/9507158
          %p
            Specifically
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/membrane+instantons"} membrane instantons
            are further discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeffrey+Harvey"}> Jeffrey Harvey
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gregory+Moore"} Gregory Moore
              %em Superpotentials and Membrane Instantons
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9907026"}> arXiv:hep-th/9907026
              )
          %p and 5-brane instantons in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Non-Perturbative Superpotentials In String Theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9604030"} arXiv:hep-th/9604030
          %p
            In the context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/F-theory"} F-theory
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
            instantons:
          %ul
            %li
              Max Kerstan,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Timo+Weigand"} Timo Weigand
